---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import FolioMark from "../components/FolioMark.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Boris Kayi, a software engineer working on energy hardware integration."
>
  <div class="page folio-page">
    <FolioMark number="02" label="About" />
    <div class="folio-body">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1>About</h1>
      </header>

      <article class="prose about-copy">
        <p>
          I’m Boris Kayi, a software engineer with experience building products and developer tools. I
          currently work at <a href="https://enpal.com">Enpal</a> as a Senior Software Engineer, focused on
          energy hardware integration.
        </p>
        <p>
          Away from work, I spend much of my time reading or building toy compilers. My interests wander:
          recently that has included energy, urbanism, books, software, and the unnoticed details between
          them. This site is where I write those things down.
        </p>
        <p>
          Code and small experiments live on <a href="https://github.com/silverhairs" rel="me">GitHub</a>.
          New entries are also available through <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="margin-note" aria-label="Current preoccupations">
        <strong>Current preoccupations</strong>
        <span>books / energy / urbanism / software / toy compilers</span>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
